%% Regenerate from the repository root:
%% PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=/usr/bin/google-chrome pnpm dlx @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli@11.12.0 -i docs/diagrams/architecture.en.mmd -o docs/public/assets/architecture.en.svg -b transparent
flowchart TD
  accTitle: Alisio package dependency architecture
  accDescr: The CLI depends on core, the SDK, and the built-in memory and subagents plugins. Core depends on the SDK. Both plugins have a peer dependency on the SDK.

  CLI["alisio CLI<br/>binary · TUI · clipboard<br/>built-in registry wiring"]
  CORE["@alisio/core<br/>runner · compaction · provider · tools<br/>runtime adapters<br/>(node:sqlite · fs · child_process)<br/>plugin host · child sessions · config<br/>createApplication"]
  MEMORY["@alisio/plugin-memory<br/>SDK peer + Zod<br/>uses the storage port"]
  SUBAGENTS["@alisio/plugin-subagents<br/>SDK peer + YAML + Zod<br/>uses api.sessions"]
  SDK["@alisio/sdk<br/>plugin contract · zero dependencies"]

  CLI ~~~ CORE ~~~ MEMORY ~~~ SUBAGENTS ~~~ SDK
  CLI -->|depends| CORE
  CLI -->|wires| MEMORY
  CLI -->|wires| SUBAGENTS
  CLI -->|depends| SDK
  CORE -->|depends| SDK
  MEMORY -.->|SDK peer| SDK
  SUBAGENTS -.->|SDK peer| SDK

  classDef cli fill:#111827,stroke:#38bdf8,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc
  classDef core fill:#172033,stroke:#60a5fa,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc
  classDef plugin fill:#202b42,stroke:#a78bfa,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc
  classDef sdk fill:#172033,stroke:#34d399,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc
  class CLI cli
  class CORE core
  class MEMORY,SUBAGENTS plugin
  class SDK sdk
